#: index.php:111
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Verzija"

#: index.php:144 index.php:286
msgid "Create bootable USB drives the easy way"
msgstr "Stvori USB pokretačke jedinice na lagan način"

#: index.php:230
msgid "Change language:"
msgstr "Promjeni jezik:"

#: index.php:239
msgid "Want to improve this translation?"
msgstr "Želite poboljšati ovaj prijevod?"

#: index.php:313
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"Rufus je aplikacija koja olakšava formatiranje i stvaranje USB pokretačkih "
"jedinica."

#: index.php:314
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "Posebno je koristan kada:"

#: index.php:316
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"trebate napraviti USB instalacijski medij iz pokretačke ISO datoteke "
"(Windows, Linux, UEFI, itd.)"

#: index.php:317
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr "radite u sustavu koji trenutno nema instaliran OS"

#: index.php:318
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr "trebate nadograditi BIOS ili drugi firmware iz DOS-a"

#: index.php:319
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "želite pokrenuti low-level program"

#: index.php:321
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr "Usprkos veličini, Rufus vam pruža sve što trebate!"

#: index.php:322
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom"
" of this page."
msgstr "Nepotpuna lista podržanih ISO slika nalazi se na dnu ove stranice."

