#: index.php:378
msgid "System Requirements:"
msgstr "Sistemski preduvjeti:"

#: index.php:379
msgid "Windows 8 or later."
msgstr "Windows 8 ili noviji."

#: index.php:379
msgid "Once downloaded, the application is ready to use."
msgstr "Jednom preuzeta, aplikacija je spremna za korištenje."

#: index.php:380
msgid "Supported Languages:"
msgstr "Podržani jezici:"

#: index.php:426
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr ""
"Iskoristit ću ovu priliku da izrazim zahvalnost svim prevoditeljima koji su "
"omogućili da Rufus, kao i ova stranica, budu prevedeni na razne jezike. "
"Ukoliko primjetite da možete koristiti Rufus na svom jeziku, stvarno bi im "
"se trebali zahvaliti!"

#: index.php:277 index.php:429
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Korištenje"

#: index.php:430
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Preuzmite izvršnu datoteku i pokrenite je &ndash; instalacija nije potrebna."

#: index.php:431
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr "Program je digitalno potpisan i potpis bi trebao glasiti:"

#: index.php:433
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 ili kasnija)"

#: index.php:434
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 ili prijašnja)"

#: index.php:436
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "DOS podrška:"

#: index.php:437
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko stvorite DOS pokretačku jedinicu, a ne koristite američku "
"tipkovnicu, Rufus će probati odabrati raspored tipkovnice u skladu s "
"regionalnom shemom sustava."

#: index.php:438
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "ISO podrška:"

#: index.php:439
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from"
" an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Sve verzije Rufusa nakon v1.1.0 dopuštaju stvaranje pokretačkog USB-a iz <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO slike</a> (.iso)."

#: index.php:440
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the"
" freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"Doduše, stvaranje ISO slike s diska ili iz datoteka lagano je ako se koriste"
" neke od besplatnih aplikacija, kao što su <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>InfraRecorder</a> ili <a target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."

#: index.php:443
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "Često postavljana pitanja (FAQ)"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after
#. "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:444
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr "FAQ je dostupan <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>OVDJE</a></b>. (na engleskom)"

#: index.php:445
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kako biste pružili feedback, prijavili grešku ili preporučili poboljšanje, "
"molimo koristite GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Ili "
"možete <a target=\"_blank\" %s>poslati e-mail</a>."

#: index.php:448
msgid "License"
msgstr "Licenca"

#: index.php:449
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) verzija 3</a> ili "
"kasnija."

#: index.php:449
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you"
" respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr ""
"Slobodni ste da distributirate, modificirate pa čak i prodajete ovaj "
"softver, sve dok poštujete GPLv3 licencu."

#: index.php:450
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"Rufus je napravljen 100%% transparentno, iz svog <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>javnog izvora</a>, koristeći <a target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a> "
"okruženje."

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after
#. "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:453
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Promjene"

#: index.php:279 index.php:485
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "Izvorni kod"

#: index.php:487
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr "Ili možete klonirati <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repozitorij pomoću:"

#: index.php:489
#, php-format
msgid "For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr ""
"Za dodatne informacije, pogledajte <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub "
"projekt</a>."

#: index.php:490
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ste programer, dobrodošli ste petljati s Rufusom i ponuditi zakrpe."

#: index.php:280 index.php:493
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Donacije"

#: index.php:494
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr ""
"Budući da me često to pitaju, na ovoj stranici <b>nema</b> gumba za "
"donacije."

#: index.php:495
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr ""
"Glavni razlog tome je što osjećam kako sustav donacija ne samo da ne pomaže "
"razvijanju softvera, nego k tomu može pobuditi i osjećaj krivnje kod "
"korisnika koji ne doniraju."

#: index.php:498
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko stvarno inzistirate, uvijek možete donirati <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>Zakladi za slobodan softver</a>, budući da su oni glavni razlog zbog "
"kojeg softver poput Rufusa uopće može postojati."

#: index.php:499
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much"
" appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"Iskoristit ću ovu priliku da kažem <i><u>hvala</u></i> na podršci i "
"entuzijazmu za ovaj mali program, cijenim to!"

#: index.php:500
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr ""
"Ali molim vas da nastavite koristite Rufus bez ikakvog osjećaja krivnje oko "
"nedoniranja &ndash; nikada to ne biste trebali!"

#: index.php:503
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr "Nepotpuni popis ISO slika s kojima Rufus oprobano radi"

